Z||000000||msweldon||09-27-2000||10:32 AM||||Does RCC Specialty Products have a website?<P>What does their bump steer kit look like?<P>Thanks,<P>------------------<BR>msweldon<P>87GT - too many suspension mods<BR>& custom true dual exhaust||||reg||1
Z||000001||Wade87GT||09-30-2000||12:23 AM||||RCC tries to keep overhead to a minimum. No website or 800 number. Hopefully this business plan can keep them going longer than Ryane did. RCC does have great customer service too. Both times I called I was able to talk tech. I order the entire front and rear tubular a-arm, coil-over shock and strut setup. Received some really beautiful pieces in less than two weeks. It should be going together this weekend. With all this, they didn't think I would need the bump-steer kit, so I didn't order it. Haven't seen any pics of it either.||||reg||1
