Z||000003||dave@heldmotorsports.com||02-19-2001||10:09 PM||||<BR>Hello to everyone in Fiero land... I would like to announce<BR>that Held Motorsports has acquired the manufacturing assets<BR>and exclusive rights to continue supplying Fiero and related<BR>products in Ryane Motorsport's portfolio. We began production<BR>on February 1st.<P>We will be displaying our products at the Spring Daytona show<BR>in March, Knott's Kit car show in Southern California in April<BR>and Carlisle in May... check out our web page:<P>        <A HREF="http://heldmotorsports.com" TARGET=_blank>http://heldmotorsports.com</A> <P>For those of you unfamiliar with our products, we provide brake<BR>and suspension upgrades for our favorite car. We are looking to<BR>expand into other areas and welcome your suggestions.<P>Dave Held<BR>dave@heldmotorsports.com||||reg||1
Z||000004||Pontiaddict||02-19-2001||10:46 PM||||Wade, how much did all of this cost?<BR>Just wondering.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Wade87GT||02-20-2001||01:52 PM||||Pontiaddict, I did all the labor myself, except the alignment. So it came to almost $2000. for everything (including the alignment).||||reg||1
