Z||000007||Wade87GT||02-21-2001||09:22 AM||||batboy, are your springs 8" or 10", and what's the load rating? How's the ride?||||reg||1
Z||000008||batboy||02-21-2001||08:37 PM||||Wade, my memory is half gone... I can't remember if those springs were 350# or 400# rates and I'm too lazy to look it up using the search. I posted the specs on the forum about a year ago. I went out and measured the springs and they were 8 inches under load. So maybe 10 inches unloaded? I don't know. It's too freakin' cold and dark right now to jack it up to find out. As for the ride, it's very firm, but I like it! This is not Grandpa's Caddy, it's a V8 powered high performance sports car playtoy. I did an entire suspension upgrade and it made a MAJOR difference in handling.||||reg||1
